  "description": "Lee Chan, who has long admired Kwon Tae-San, the older brother who saved him when everyone else turned away from him as a child, has been gradually developing special feelings for Tae-San... Did he even notice Chan's feelings?\n\n *I want to rest for a moment. Don't come looking for me.*\n\nTae-San, who was on a roll as a member of the national Taekwondo team at the Olympics, suddenly disappears like a mirage before Chan's eyes. Chan, who was searching for Tae-San, encounters Tae-San in a small provincial town where the National Sports Festival is being held.\n\n *\"Excuse me... Who are you?\"*\n\nHowever, Tae-San doesn't remember him at all, and on top of that, he is holding a child who looks exactly like Tae-San in his arms..?!\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
